@oscar-wallis  Pushed `131f4ad` to fix the coverage regression on `deprecation.py`.

This PR removes the qubit auto-alignment code from `adjust_num_qubits.py`, which was the only path in the test suite exercising `issue_deprecation_msg()` — dropping the file's coverage to 40%. Added `test/utils/test_deprecation.py` covering `issue_deprecation_msg`, `deprecate_function`, and `deprecate_arguments` directly. Locally: 5/5 passing, 100% coverage on the file.

Note: `deprecate_function`/`deprecate_arguments` are actually unused dead code repo-wide — tested them here for coverage, but happy to remove instead in a follow-up if preferred.
